        "detailed_description": "<h1>🧩 Complete Your Collection with 50% OFF!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Looking for the full Puzzle Gallery experience?<br>Get the <strong>Entire Collection Bundle</strong> — all DLCs released so far, together at a <strong>special 50% discount</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎁 <strong>Offer available on the DLC pages!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979440/extras/b6afec522dd29f53cefea3461ea3e45c.avif?t=1761839838\" width=920 height=430 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🧩 Real Art, Real Puzzles</strong><br>Solve puzzles crafted from <strong>authentic artworks by invited artists</strong>.<br>Each DLC is a curated collection — <strong>like visiting a new gallery of art.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979440/extras/c6f1206e40314a5677ef798ef9ae6899.poster.avif?t=1761839838\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979440/extras/c6f1206e40314a5677ef798ef9ae6899.webm?t=1761839838\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979440/extras/c6f1206e40314a5677ef798ef9ae6899.mp4?t=1761839838\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🎨 Curated Collections</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with <strong>4 free puzzles</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand with <strong>DLC packs featuring exclusive artworks</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every artist brings a <strong>unique theme and vision</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>⚙️ Features Built for Puzzle Lovers</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>5 levels with classic cuts</strong> (48–432 pieces)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>5 levels with irregular cuts</strong> (48–432 pieces)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Zoom &amp; multi-selection</strong> for smooth control</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Border filter, quadrant selector, shuffle &amp; reference image</strong> to guide your progress</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Autosave and achievements</strong> to track milestones</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979440/extras/c11b50b0347f83655421579d68d6a74f.poster.avif?t=1761839838\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979440/extras/c11b50b0347f83655421579d68d6a74f.webm?t=1761839838\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979440/extras/c11b50b0347f83655421579d68d6a74f.mp4?t=1761839838\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🌙 Relax and Enjoy</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>clean, intuitive interface</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relaxing ambient music</strong> and <strong>satisfying sound effects</strong> that feel just like placing real puzzle pieces</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>fair model</strong>: free base game + accessible DLCs</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\